From dc5a4137f1f78d02fc6cc1023909567bea1dcc14 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: 258ryan <ryanmiranda852@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 14 Nov 2026 06:43:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] overlay: skeuomorphic framework widgets (gel buttons,
 recessed switch/progress/slider tracks, glass dialogs and popups, groove
 text-field underline)

Build-time resource overlay on framework-res. The drawables still follow the theme colours
(colorButtonNormal, colorControlActivated, colorBackground).
---
